          ":question/problem": "Find $\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial z}$ for $f(x,y,z)=\\left(- 2 x - 2 y\\right) \\sin{\\left(z \\right)} + \\left(- 2 x - 2 z\\right) \\cos{\\left(y \\right)}$.",
